1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:01,863
On dirait des sushis,

2
00:00:01,863 --> 00:00:03,443
baguettes comprises.

3
00:00:03,710 --> 00:00:05,218
Prends un morceau…

4
00:00:05,218 --> 00:00:06,985
ce sont des chaussettes.

5
00:00:07,077 --> 00:00:08,005
Cinq paires,

6
00:00:08,005 --> 00:00:09,253
cinq modèles :

7
00:00:09,253 --> 00:00:11,085
saumon, tamago, maki.

8
00:00:11,085 --> 00:00:12,125
Drôles à ouvrir,

9
00:00:12,125 --> 00:00:13,400
et elles ne finissent pas au

10
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:14,772
fond d'un tiroir.

11
00:00:15,030 --> 00:00:16,507
Dès le lendemain matin,

12
00:00:16,507 --> 00:00:17,740
elles sont aux pieds.

